# Incident Prioritization

Not every incident requires the same level of response.

Factors influencing prioritization include:

- Business impact.
- Severity.
- Asset criticality.
- Confidence level.
- Threat intelligence.
- Number of affected systems.
- Evidence of successful compromise.

Prioritization ensures limited resources are focused on the highest-risk incidents.

